        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "The firearm has recently been zeroed by the hunter."
        },
        {
          "id": "e",
          "text": "There is sufficient Kugelfang to stop the flight of the bullet after the shot."
        },
        {
          "id": "f",
